# Project conventions (index)

Quick checklist; full wording is in the files under `.cursor/rules/`.

- **Build / dev server / typecheck**: Never run unless the user asks — `00-global-safety.mdc`.
- **Tests**: Do not add, modify, or run tests unless the user asks — `05-workflow-execution.mdc`. Vitest + Nuxt project layout and config files — `testing-vitest-nuxt.mdc`.
- **Prisma / migrations**: Shared client and migration policy — `backend-best-practices.mdc` (sections **Data Access** and **Prisma schema and migrations**). **Account membership** (`UserAccount` capabilities, list filtering) — **Data Access** in `backend-best-practices.mdc`; microservice env — `backend-security-and-ops.mdc`.
- **Encrypted field queries**: Never `in`/`contains` on `@encrypted` columns — `encrypted-prisma-queries.mdc`; details — `.agent/logic/encryption-and-keys.mdc`.
- **Plaid**: Sync + balance write path — `plaid-sync.mdc`; encyclopedia — `.agent/logic/plaid.mdc`.
- **Register balances** (`balance` vs `latestBalance`): `register-balances.mdc`; model notes — `.agent/logic/data-model.mdc`.
- **Forecast money rounding**: `forecast-money-rounding.mdc`; engine notes — `.agent/logic/forecast-engine.mdc`.
- **Code style / TS / Zod**: `10-code-style-and-ts.mdc`.

## Domain docs (`.agent/logic/`)

Read the matching file when working in that area (not always-applied):

- `overview.mdc` — purpose / stack
- `architecture.mdc` — directory map
- `data-model.mdc` — Prisma entities, balance fields
- `api-surface.mdc` — API routes
- `queues-and-cron.mdc` — BullMQ + cron
- `encryption-and-keys.mdc` — field encryption
- `plaid.mdc` — Plaid link / sync / balances
- `forecast-engine.mdc` — forecast modules
- `microservice.mdc` — companion service
- `deployment.mdc` — CI / GKE
- `patterns.mdc` — conventions (respect agent policy above)
- `testing.mdc` — how tests are organized
